    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the difference in specificity (%) between TBST and QFT in children: DST 5mm vs QFT 10.60 (2.30 to 18.90; Starshinova 2018a) and C-Tb vs QFT 6.50 (−5.25 to 18.25; Aggerbeck 2018). The overall random-effects pooled difference is 9.21 (−15.46 to 33.88).",
